{"seq":1,"slug":"entity-resolution-linking","title":"实体解析与身份链接：确定性/概率匹配与 PII 归一化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/identity-graph-resolution/entity-resolution-linking","wordCount":3218,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"实体解析与身份链接-确定性-概率匹配与-pii-归一化\">实体解析与身份链接：确定性/概率匹配与 PII 归一化</h1><p>买家下单用的邮箱是 <code>a.li@gmail.com</code>、收货手机是 <code>+86 138****2211</code>、设备指纹是浏览器 Canvas 哈希；两分钟后同一个人换了邮箱 <code>ali+promo@gmail.com</code>、用同一张虚拟卡在另一台设备下单。合成身份攻击者只需为每个「人」换一层轻量外壳，就能把分散在多个账号下的欺诈流量拆成互不相关的孤立事件。<strong>实体解析（entity resolution）与身份链接（identity linking）就是把同一实体散落的多条观测收敛成一个身份节点、再把节点连成图的工程层</strong>，它位于合成身份建模之上、图模型检测之下。本篇拆解 PII 归一化、确定性匹配、概率匹配三个机制，以及它们如何从「配对判断」升级为「图谱聚类」。本章边界见 <a href=\"./\">本册索引</a>，攻击者构造身份的上游手法见 <a href=\"../synthetic-identity-taxonomy/\">合成身份分类体系</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么身份链接是合成身份检测的前置问题\">核心概念：为什么身份链接是合成身份检测的前置问题</h2><p>合成身份的核心特征是<strong>身份要素不是偷来的，而是拼装出来的</strong>：一个从未真实存在的社会安全号（SSN）或身份证号、一个真实但不属于本人的姓名、一个合理但伪造的出生日期。这与盗用型欺诈（account takeover）完全不同——盗用型的两条记录天然指向同一个真人，证件号、地址高度一致，链接很容易；合成身份的两条记录之间往往只有<strong>弱关联</strong>：同一设备指纹、同一收货地址的模糊变体、同一段 IP、同一张礼品卡号。攻击者刻意让强标识符（证件号、法定姓名）每次都不同，只留少量弱标识符做「黏合剂」。</p>\n<p>这意味着身份链接的召回率直接决定检测天花板。若链接层要求强标识符完全一致才合并节点，每个假身份都成为独立节点，图模型上看到的是一群互不相连的「正常人」，bust-out 前的养号行为完全藏在噪声里。反之，若链接层过于激进，把真实用户的共享设备（家庭共用平板、公司公用电脑、网吧）误合并，就会把正常用户卷进欺诈子图，产生大量误报——误报的代价是冻结真实订单，直接损失 GMV。因此工程目标不是「尽量多连」，而是<strong>在可解释的置信度下做可调、可回滚的合并决策</strong>。NIST SP 800-63A 把身份证明分解成解析、验证、绑定三阶段，其中「绑定」正是本层解决的命题。两条外部要求共同规定：本层产出必须带证据、带置信度、可审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pii-归一化-把脏输入变成可比对的规范形\">PII 归一化：把脏输入变成可比对的规范形</h2><p>未经归一化的字符串比对是对抗性的自欺。同一手机号有十几种写法，同一姓名横跨 Unicode、拼音、日文假名、阿拉伯文音译，同一邮箱可用 Gmail 的点号与加号别名伪装成不同地址。归一化层的职责是<strong>在尽量不丢失区分信号的前提下把每条标识符映射到规范形</strong>，同时保留原始值用于展示与取证。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标识符</th>\n<th>归一化要点</th>\n<th>典型陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>姓名</td>\n<td>NFKC 折叠、大小写折叠、去标点空白；跨语言做音译（拼音、罗马字、西里尔转写）</td>\n<td>音译多对一（<code>张伟</code>/<code>Zhang Wei</code>）；应保留原生形与音译形两套键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮箱</td>\n<td>本地部分与域名分别小写；域名做 IDN/punycode 统一；识别 Gmail 点号忽略与 <code>+</code> 别名</td>\n<td><code>+</code> 别名被攻击者反向利用做「同人不同址」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电话</td>\n<td>解析为 E.164 规范形，用号段规则校验长度与有效性</td>\n<td>虚拟号/一次性号（VoIP）需单独标注来源可信度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地址</td>\n<td>结构化拆分省市区街门牌；接入地址标准化服务做规范形与可投递性判定</td>\n<td>跨境格式差异极大，单一国家规则会大批失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证件号</td>\n<td>去分隔符、统一大小写；按签发国规则校验校验位</td>\n<td>美国 SSA 自 2011 年起随机化 SSN 号段，旧「无效区号」校验规则已不可靠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备与网络</td>\n<td>指纹取稳定分量而非易变分量；IP 归一到 ASN 与地理粒度</td>\n<td>IDFA 需授权、GAID 在广告场景受限，不可作为稳定主键</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>归一化的产出应当是<strong>多键存储（multi-key store）</strong>：每个标识符同时保存原始值、规范值与类型化键（如 <code>phone:E164:+8613...</code>）。下游既可用规范键做确定性匹配，也可回退到模糊算法比较原始值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确定性匹配-锚点-精确键与它的边界\">确定性匹配：锚点、精确键与它的边界</h2><p>确定性匹配（deterministic matching）用精确规则判断两条记录是否同一实体：规范化证件号完全一致且未被标记为已泄露/复用，或已验证邮箱/手机与另一条记录完全一致，即判定同一身份。它<strong>可解释、可复现、几乎零误报</strong>，适合作为图谱中的「锚点边」（anchor edge）。四个工程要点：</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>区分已验证与未验证标识符</strong>。注册时填写的邮箱是「声明的」，点击验证链接或短信验证码后才成为「已验证的」。攻击者常用真实可收信邮箱通过声明阶段，但通常不会长期维护它；把两类混为一谈会让锚点边大量失效。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>锚点不能只依赖单一类型</strong>。只看证件号会被伪造证件号规避；只看设备会误合并共用设备。工程做法是<strong>要求多个独立标识符同时一致</strong>才升级为锚点，例如「已验证手机 + 已验证邮箱 + 同一支付工具指纹」三者同时命中，这类似 NIST SP 800-63A 多来源证明主体的思路。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>处理标识符生命周期</strong>。手机号会回收再分配、邮箱会注销、设备会被转卖。必须记录每个标识符的首次出现、末次出现与验证时间；若某设备指纹在旧账号上末次出现是三个月前、又在新账号上首次出现，应降低权重而非直接判定共享。</p>\n<p>第四，<strong>规则必须可版本化</strong>。规则变更都会改变历史图谱形态。把规则集版本写入每条边的元数据，使链接可回溯，否则事后审计无法解释某账号为何被并入欺诈子图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"概率匹配-fellegi-sunter-与可调阈值\">概率匹配：Fellegi–Sunter 与可调阈值</h2><p>当强标识符不一致、只有弱标识符部分重合时，确定性规则失效，需要概率匹配。经典框架来自 Fellegi 与 Sunter 1969 年的记录链接模型：对每个比较字段计算权重，度量「该字段取值一致」在「同一实体」假设下比在「不同实体」假设下可能性高多少。用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示字段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 在同一实体对中匹配的概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示不同实体对偶然匹配的概率，一致与不一致情形的权重分别为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>match</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mfrac><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>nonmatch</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k^{\\text{match}} = \\log_2 \\frac{m_k}{u_k}, \\qquad w_k^{\\text{nonmatch}} = \\log_2 \\frac{1 - m_k}{1 - u_k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">match</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">nonmatch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>总分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = \\sum_k w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与两阈值比较：高于上阈值判定匹配，低于下阈值判定不匹配，落在中间地带交给人工或更深模型。这套模型把「凭感觉定相似度」变成<strong>可用标注数据估计的参数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从匹配对中估计，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从随机配对估计（同字段值的经验频率，或基于生日悖论的随机碰撞率）。跨境场景里姓名音译的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 很高（大量人同音），姓名权重天然低；罕见中间名或高熵设备指纹的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 极低，权重天然高。实践经验：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>字段比较要分档</strong>。姓名用编辑距离或 Jaro–Winkler 相似度分档，地址用分词集合相似度分档，邮箱用「本地部分相似但域名相同」单独成档；离散化可让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 估计更稳定。</li>\n<li><strong>为可扩展性做分块（blocking）</strong>。全量两两比较是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，十亿级不可行。先按高区分度规范键（规范化手机号、地址地理哈希、邮箱域名+本地前几位）分桶，只在桶内比较，多个分块键取并集提高召回。分块键选择直接决定召回上限——两个真匹配记录若没有任何一个分块键相同，就永远不会被比较到。</li>\n<li><strong>用主动学习代替盲目标注</strong>。阈值附近的配对信息量最大：先跑一轮，抽取中间地带样本人工标注，重估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再迭代。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>概率匹配的输出不是二元判断，而是<strong>每条边的匹配分数与贡献字段明细</strong>——分数必须可反查到「哪些字段把它推过阈值」，这既是可解释性的落点，也是下游调查环节的输入，见 <a href=\"../investigation-ops-compliance/\">调查运营与合规处置</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从配对到图谱-连通分量-聚类与冲突消解\">从配对到图谱：连通分量、聚类与冲突消解</h2><p>「这两条像不像一个人」与「这一组记录怎么划分成身份簇」不是同一个问题，因为匹配关系不满足传递性：A 与 B 匹配、B 与 C 匹配，并不意味着 A 与 C 匹配——这就是经典的链式误合并。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始观测&lt;br/&gt;账号/设备/支付/地址] --&gt; B[PII 归一化&lt;br/&gt;多键存储]&#10;    B --&gt; C{锚点规则}&#10;    C --&gt;|命中多锚点| D[可信锚点边]&#10;    C --&gt;|仅弱标识符| E[概率匹配打分]&#10;    E --&gt; F[分块内配对比较&lt;br/&gt;Fellegi-Sunter 权重]&#10;    F --&gt; G[边分数与贡献字段]&#10;    D --&gt; H[图聚类与冲突消解]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[身份簇&lt;br/&gt;带置信度与证据]&#10;    I --&gt; J[下游图模型检测]\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始观测&lt;br/&gt;账号/设备/支付/地址] --&gt; B[PII 归一化&lt;br/&gt;多键存储]\n    B --&gt; C{锚点规则}\n    C --&gt;|命中多锚点| D[可信锚点边]\n    C --&gt;|仅弱标识符| E[概率匹配打分]\n    E --&gt; F[分块内配对比较&lt;br/&gt;Fellegi-Sunter 权重]\n    F --&gt; G[边分数与贡献字段]\n    D --&gt; H[图聚类与冲突消解]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[身份簇&lt;br/&gt;带置信度与证据]\n    I --&gt; J[下游图模型检测]</pre><p>聚类层的四个关键设计选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>连通分量 vs 加权聚类</strong>。把超过阈值的边连成连通分量最朴素，但对链式误合并极脆弱——一条高分的错误边能把两个大簇桥接成一个。更稳健的是带约束聚类（要求簇内任意两点满足一定相似度）或基于社区发现（标签传播、Louvain 类）对边权重做软划分。</li>\n<li><strong>冲突消解（conflict resolution）</strong>。当两条记录同时符合多个互斥身份（如同一证件号绑定两个不同姓名）时，需要显式规则决定如何拆分。常见策略是「以已验证标识符为准、弱标识符只能同向支持不能反向推翻」，并对互斥信号告警。</li>\n<li><strong>增量与全量的一致性</strong>。常用「增量维护 + 周期性全量重算对账」双轨：增量保证时效，全量重算发现累积漂移。</li>\n<li><strong>图谱本身要可查询</strong>。身份簇、边、证据字段需落在能做多跳邻域查询的存储里，否则下游跨设备图网络分析无法在可接受延迟内取到子图，见 <a href=\"../graph-fraud-detection-ml/\">图欺诈检测模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结-评估-阈值运营与监管边界\">小结：评估、阈值运营与监管边界</h2><p>真实分布里绝大多数配对都不匹配，一个全判「不匹配」的模型准确率可以高达 99.99% 而毫无用处。评估必须同时落在两个维度：<strong>配对层</strong>用精确率、召回率与 F1 度量阈值好坏，是调阈值的直接依据；<strong>簇层</strong>用 B-cubed 精确率/召回率或簇熵度量最终身份簇与真值的吻合度，惩罚把大簇错误裂成多个小簇（或反之）的行为。B-cubed 对元素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 的召回为其预测簇与真值簇的交叠比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Recall</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∩</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Recall}(e) = \\frac{|C(e) \\cap G(e)|}{|G(e)|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为预测簇、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为真实簇，全局指标逐元素取平均。簇层指标高并不意味配对层指标必然高——这是链式误合并的典型表现，因此两个维度必须同时监控。</p>\n<p>运营上有三条机制必须落地。<strong>阈值是策略参数而非常数</strong>：注册场景可宽松以尽早捕获养号，支付场景必须收紧以免冻结正常订单，应为每个场景维护独立的阈值与规则集。<strong>合并决策可回滚</strong>：身份簇一旦合成就影响下游所有决策，发现误合并时必须能追溯到具体边并拆解，这要求每条边带版本与证据。<strong>监管边界写进设计</strong>：GDPR 第 22 条限制对个人产生法律或重大影响的完全自动化决策并赋予解释权，美国 FCRA、ECOA 与 Regulation B 对以消费者报告为依据的决策另有通知与异议要求。</p>\n<p>本层最终交付一个<strong>可解释、可回溯、带置信度的身份图谱</strong>：规范化多键存储提供可比对输入，确定性锚点提供高精度骨架，概率匹配填补弱关联，聚类把这些边收敛成身份簇。质量上限由归一化与分块决定，业务安全边界由阈值与可回滚机制决定。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实体解析与身份链接：确定性/概率匹配与 PII 归一化","id":"实体解析与身份链接-确定性-概率匹配与-pii-归一化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么身份链接是合成身份检测的前置问题","id":"核心概念-为什么身份链接是合成身份检测的前置问题"},{"level":2,"text":"PII 归一化：把脏输入变成可比对的规范形","id":"pii-归一化-把脏输入变成可比对的规范形"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性匹配：锚点、精确键与它的边界","id":"确定性匹配-锚点-精确键与它的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"概率匹配：Fellegi–Sunter 与可调阈值","id":"概率匹配-fellegi-sunter-与可调阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"从配对到图谱：连通分量、聚类与冲突消解","id":"从配对到图谱-连通分量-聚类与冲突消解"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：评估、阈值运营与监管边界","id":"小结-评估-阈值运营与监管边界"}],"prev":{"title":"欺诈损失分类与度量口径：申请欺诈、交易欺诈与损失归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/synthetic-identity-taxonomy/fraud-loss-taxonomy-metrics"},"next":{"title":"身份图谱 schema 与数据血缘：节点/边建模、设备指纹与来源可信度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/identity-graph-resolution/graph-schema-provenance"}}